          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵandu ŵiŵawusile kutyocela ku ukapolo ŵatesile Pasaka",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " pa lisiku lya 14 lya mwesi wandanda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.12.1+EXO.12.2+EXO.12.3+EXO.12.4+EXO.12.5+EXO.12.6+EXO.12.7+EXO.12.8+EXO.12.9+EXO.12.10+EXO.12.11+EXO.12.12+EXO.12.13+EXO.12.14+EXO.12.15+EXO.12.16+EXO.12.17+EXO.12.18+EXO.12.19+EXO.12.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Eks 12:1-20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵakutaga mbopesi ni Alefi wosope ŵaliswejesye, nipo ŵaliji ŵaswela. Myoyo Alefi ŵawulajile mwanace jwangondolo jwa Pasaka ŵandu wosope ŵiŵawusile ku ukapolo, ŵakutaga mbopesi acimjawo ni jemanjajo acimsyene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbopesi ja ngondolo ja Pasakajo jalilidwe ni Aisalaeli wosope ŵele ŵaŵawusile kutyocela ku ukapolo, ni wosope ŵiŵalesile misyungu jakusakala ja ŵandu ŵaŵatamaga mcilambomo ni cakulinga cakuti ŵalambileje AMBUJE, Mlungu juŵamlambilaga Aisalaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa masiku msano ni gaŵili ŵandu ŵasangalalile cindimba ca mkate wangali cakusasaŵilisya,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " pakuti AMBUJE ŵasengwesye jemanjajo ni kuwupitikusya mtima wa mwenye jwa ku Asiliya, mwakuti jwalakwejo ŵakamucisye jemanjajo pa masengo gawo gakutaŵa soni Nyumba ja AMBUJE, Mlungu juŵamlambilaga Aisalaeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.22"
            ]
          }
        }
